# POLLY, mutes: a mute is the song's, per track, in every section; never an edit of the pattern (a style's
# section stays the style's: no user pattern taken). Saved with the song, per song. A pattern saved with its
# own mute (before mutes were the song's) gives it to the song when loaded. Songs of format 4 load (no mutes,
# the style from their sections).
wait 300
expect song1_style1 33
expect dirty 0
tap SEQ
expect page 1
spin K4 1
wait 100
expect trk5_mute 1
expect song1_mute 16
expect ptrk5_mute 0
expect song1_style1 33
expect msg_is_NEW 0
shot muted.png
# muted in every section: the Intro, then Main A, then Main B
tap HOME
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 4100
expect sect 2
press SEL
tapkey b2
release SEL
wait 4100
expect sect 3
expect track_hits5 0
expect track_hits4 >0
tap PLAY
wait 200
# unmuted: it plays again
tap SEQ
spin K4 -1
wait 200
expect trk5_mute 0
expect song1_mute 0
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 4100
tap PLAY
expect track_hits5 >0
expect song1_style1 33
expect song1_style2 34
# saved with the song, across a reboot; song 2's own
spin K4 1
wait 200
tap SAVE
wait 50
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect song1_mute 16
expect trk5_mute 1
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 4100
tap PLAY
expect track_hits5 0
press SEL
turn PRESET 1
release SEL
wait 100
expect song 2
expect song2_mute 0
expect trk5_mute 0
hitreset
tap PLAY
wait 4100
tap PLAY
expect track_hits5 >0
# a pattern holding its own mute (an older save): the song's now, out of the pattern; saved so
poke_muted_pattern
reboot
wait 300
expect song 1
expect song1_style1 0
expect song1_mute 16
expect trk5_mute 1
expect ptrk5_mute 0
expect dirty 1
tap SAVE
wait 50
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect song1_mute 16
expect ptrk5_mute 0
tap SEQ
spin K4 -1
wait 100
expect song1_mute 0
expect trk5_mute 0
